              <h3>Sentinel</h3>
              <p>A detection pipeline that runs Wazuh, Splunk, and Security Onion in parallel, with Shuffle for SOAR and a local LLM doing first-pass triage before a human sees it. It took MITRE ATT&amp;CK coverage from <span class="num">9</span> techniques to <span class="num">15</span>.</p>
