              <h3>Prism</h3>
              <p>Federated anomaly detection for OT/ICS. A temporal VAE learns each site&rsquo;s baseline, and only masked model weights leave the plant, so raw telemetry never does. False positives stayed under <span class="num">8%</span> across <span class="num">7</span> simulated sites.</p>
