            <article class="project" id="s-axon">
              <h3>Axon</h3>
              <p>Risk-adaptive authentication. Every attempt gets a live risk score from device, location, and behavior. Low risk passes silently; high risk gets step-up per NIST&nbsp;800-63B.</p>
